{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "english", "appid": 548430, "month": "2019-09", "window": 3, "start_date": 1568592000, "end_date": 1569283199, "month_true_total": 627, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:20:12 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "55252974", "author": {"steamid": "76561198083769348", "personaname": "The Pie Is A Lie", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198083769348/", "num_games_owned": 491, "num_reviews": 66, "playtime_forever": 37992, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1116, "last_played": 1784414543, "avatar": "fc8a95213bc6f56532a6dde4a724bd726d828d13"}, "language": "english", "review": "It can really get quite intense, and you can play numerous different playstyles, is good", "timestamp_created": 1569282963, "timestamp_updated": 1569282963, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55252604", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993243809", "personaname": "Majestic Trax", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/traxzilla/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 12556, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5968, "last_played": 1759365175, "avatar": "e4c5e2ab869df41657cb2108f0d01723d0ba7ba7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Do you like Dwarfs? Do you enjoy plundering the riches of the earth? Does the thought of turning nasty alien bugs into a fine meat spray make you feel tingly? Then this game is for you.\n\nDeep Rock Galactic is a four player co-op game from a small studio, with an enjoyable gameplay loop and a good variety of missions. You mine things, kill aliens, drink beer, and kick barrels (not necessarily in that order). It has an active and communicative dev team, the graphics are effective and fit the game well, the sound is pretty good, it performs well even on older machines, and is fairly free of serious bugs. The game is balanced around co-op and different class abilities but includes a special robot pal for people who prefer solo runs, and it works pretty well.\n\nDeep Rock's biggest issues in my opinion are the poor balance in some areas (perks, some monster spawn patterns), limited voice actors/character models, griefing and limited end game content. All of these are acknowledge by the developer and being worked on.", "timestamp_created": 1569280819, "timestamp_updated": 1569280819, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55252423", "author": {"steamid": "76561197992712958", "personaname": "Sal Amander", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197992712958/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 32515, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 800, "last_played": 1707277635, "avatar": "019302179bd8e3a7445db8ea2363af4db8d127a3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Rock and stone, brothers!\n\nGroup up with your friends or just some surly characters you met at the station pub, and get to mining!\n\nJust don't be surprised if something down there doesn't appreciate you taking their valuables.", "timestamp_created": 1569279742, "timestamp_updated": 1569279742, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck":